 3 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release Date:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">November 11, 2022 (JP)<br />February 24, 2023 (EN)<br />November 19, 2025 (TH)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 4 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Set Gallery Japanese:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cf-vanguard.com/cardlist/cardsearch/?expansion=241\">VG-D-SS03</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 5 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Set Gallery English:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.cf-vanguard.com/cardlist/cardsearch/?expansion=200\">VGE-D-SS03</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 6 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Set Gallery Thai:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.thaivanguard.net/product/d-ss03/\">VGT-D-SS03</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 7 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Previous Set:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/D_Special_Series_02:_Festival_Collection_2022\" title=\"D Special Series 02: Festival Collection 2022\">D Special Series 02: Festival Collection 2022</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 8 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Next Set:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/D_Special_Series_04:_Stride_Deckset_Messiah\" title=\"D Special Series 04: Stride Deckset Messiah\">D Special Series 04: Stride Deckset Messiah</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<b>Stride Deckset Chronojet</b> is the 3rd <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"D-icon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/cardfight/images/6/64/D-icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/18?cb=20240213094726\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"D-icon.png\" data-image-key=\"D-icon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_Cardfight!!_Vanguard_Special_Series\" title=\"List of Cardfight!! Vanguard Special Series\">Special Series</a> released in the Japanese, English, and Thai formats.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Contents\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Contents</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Set_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Set Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Card_List\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Card List</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Nation/Grade_Breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Nation/Grade Breakdown</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Contents\">Contents</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fcardfight.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FD_Special_Series_03%3A_Stride_Deckset_Chronojet%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Pre-constructed deck (50 + 13 cards)\n<ul><li>Includes 19 different cards (14 new cards, 5 reprints)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Short Storage Box</li>\n<li>Acrylic Fighter's Coins (15 coins)</li>\n<li>Fighter's Coin Customization Sticker Sheet (30 stickers)</li>\n<li>Includes support for the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_States\" title=\"Dark States\">Dark States</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Nation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nation\">nation</a>.</li>\n<li>The Thai edition instead features SP-foiling treatment for TDR cards, available for all cards.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Set_Gallery\">Set Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fcardfight.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FD_Special_Series_03%3A_Stride_Deckset_Chronojet%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg><